  // junk comments) -> anti-analysis (mutex file, timed loops) -> WMI
  // PartOfDomain gate: non-domain hosts get only a UAC loop -> runas loop until
  // elevated -> Defender exclusions c:..i:, EnableLUA=0 -> renamed 7-Zip (7g.exe)
